@startuml
[*] --> OPEN
OPEN --> INVESTIGATING: start investigation
INVESTIGATING --> PENDING_REVIEW: QA needs review
PENDING_REVIEW --> INVESTIGATING: revise
PENDING_REVIEW --> FILED: human approve + file SAR
INVESTIGATING --> FILED: QA approves (confidence >= 0.85)
INVESTIGATING --> DISMISSED: no suspicion
FILED --> CLOSED: filed
CLOSED --> [*]
DISMISSED --> [*]
@enduml